{"data":[{"author_id":"1969676558324678657","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:01:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109856925705699483"],"id":"2109856925705699483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI coding models score ~80% on the \"easy\" benchmark (SWE-Bench Verified) — and crash to ~23% on the harder version (SWE-Bench Pro) built to resist pattern-matching. The \"AI is replacing developers\" narrative just got a reality check.","url":"https://x.com/mamin_1993/status/2109856925705699483"},{"author_id":"1687093333124845568","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:11:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110463406843056156"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"A space to discuss and keep up software development and manage your software career","display_url":"dev.to","end":25,"expanded_url":"https://dev.to","images":[{"height":500,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109833414425944064/HKWFBIRz?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1000},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109833414425944064/HKWFBIRz?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":2,"status":200,"title":"DEV Community","unwound_url":"https://dev.to","url":"https://t.co/XB3HbTksDb"}]},"id":"2110463406843056156","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"a https://t.co/XB3HbTksDb post argues swe-bench is the wrong benchmark for deciding if a local llm can replace claude code.\nmy lean: the only test that matters is a real ticket in my own repo.\nwhat task do you hand a new coding model first?","url":"https://x.com/AdityaMittal87/status/2110463406843056156"},{"author_id":"2106550370243952641","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:21:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110164061916954957"],"id":"2110164061916954957","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Liquid AI shipped a 24B open-weight agent model that activates only 2B per token. It beats a larger Qwen MoE by 3x on one tool benchmark, and loses to it by 15 points on SWE-Bench. Which half of that table matters for a local agent?","url":"https://x.com/alfw_ai/status/2110164061916954957"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110106326894579712"]},"author_id":"1765633660588576768","created_at":"2026-10-13T20:59:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110113232501567805"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":74,"id":"746788615951355904","start":64,"username":"OfirPress"},{"end":88,"id":"616998786","start":76,"username":"jyangballin"},{"end":101,"id":"1124834159841562624","start":94,"username":"closji"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jHxyHEd9n8","end":261,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ValsAI/status/2110113232501567805/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110106326894579712","start":238,"url":"https://t.co/jHxyHEd9n8"}]},"id":"2110113232501567805","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":7806,"like_count":168,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":8},"text":"SWE-Bench Multimodal is now on Vals!\n\nThe benchmark, created by @OfirPress, @jyangballin, and @closji,  asks a model to fix a real GitHub issue in a JavaScript repository, where the bug report depends on a screenshot or other visual cue. https://t.co/jHxyHEd9n8","url":"https://x.com/ValsAI/status/2110113232501567805"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110083948462460928"]},"author_id":"2098704538056466432","created_at":"2026-10-13T19:03:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110084056079593860"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/fX9u1vM3qI","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/MuseTalks/status/2110084056079593860/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110083948462460928","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/fX9u1vM3qI"}]},"id":"2110084056079593860","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"cais built a benchmark out of honeypots. every frontier model cheated when honest work got hard. grok 4.6: 81.5%. gpt-6 astra, the most honest, still cut corners 48.2%. berkeley showed swe-bench and webarena are gameable too. i stopped trusting single numbers on leaderboards. https://t.co/fX9u1vM3qI","url":"https://x.com/MuseTalks/status/2110084056079593860"},{"author_id":"1437374966312280069","created_at":"2026-10-13T15:43:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110033569695531219"],"id":"2110033569695531219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Every AI lab drops a new benchmark radar chart every 3 weeks just so their model lands in the top-right corner.\n\nStop showing me MMLU trivia scores. Show me SWE-bench on a 7-year-old messy repo with 0 documentation.","url":"https://x.com/Avinaba_/status/2110033569695531219"},{"author_id":"2038833015246159872","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:37:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110001997009375284"],"id":"2110001997009375284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Memento 3 Achieves 100% RHAE Ceiling on ARC-AGI-3 Benchmark October 10, \nResearchers from University College London and Huawei’s Noah’s Ark Lab released Memento 3, hitting a perfect 100.0 score across all public ARC-AGI-3 reasoning tasks by pairing a frozen LLM with an executable","url":"https://x.com/ABHI__YADAV_001/status/2110001997009375284"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110258456460488704"]},"author_id":"1198703901270249479","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:37:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110258774468448607"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/7oMcKQkTlF","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/DogukanUrker/status/2110258774468448607/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110258456460488704","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/7oMcKQkTlF"}]},"id":"2110258774468448607","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":39,"impression_count":7633,"like_count":134,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"text":"ran my agentic coding benchmark on LFM2.5-24B-A2B. same 20 PatchEval tasks, Pi agent, single RTX 3060. (config below)\n\n8/20. Qwen3.8-27B and Qwen3.6-35B-A3B both get 16, Ornith-1.5-35B gets 15.\n\nzero loops, it never got stuck, it just didn’t land the fixes.\n\nand this is inside https://t.co/7oMcKQkTlF","url":"https://x.com/DogukanUrker/status/2110258774468448607"},{"author_id":"1470068344996909065","created_at":"2026-10-13T17:10:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110055684272521429"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/fchollet/statu…","end":142,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/fchollet/status/2110042948821975317","start":119,"url":"https://t.co/xRgT1PqOYN"}]},"id":"2110055684272521429","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":53,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"How does it score on Arc AGI 3?\n\nWhen will this benchmark be saturated to?\n\nIs there anything deep learning cannot do? https://t.co/xRgT1PqOYN","url":"https://x.com/santygegen/status/2110055684272521429"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109756911860015104"]},"author_id":"1536693901230321666","created_at":"2026-10-12T22:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109777381766664645"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Bu4TfXBmMZ","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/RoundtableSpace/status/2109777381766664645/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109756911860015104","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/Bu4TfXBmMZ"}]},"id":"2109777381766664645","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":47617,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"Meta's own benchmark table shows Muse Wonder Full ahead of Claude Opus 5.5, Claude Fable 5.1 and GPT-6 Astra on long-horizon coding and memory, while Opus 5.5 still leads the Artificial Analysis Index 58 to 56.\n\n→ Meta reports Muse Wonder Full scoring 79.0 on DeepSWE and 57.5 on https://t.co/Bu4TfXBmMZ","url":"https://x.com/RoundtableSpace/status/2109777381766664645"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110384516439093248","3_2110384560789757952","3_2110384623716880384"]},"author_id":"593047872","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:50:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110397876337586635"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CV2qr6Ek5s","end":307,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FakePsyho/status/2110397876337586635/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110384516439093248","start":284,"url":"https://t.co/CV2qr6Ek5s"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CV2qr6Ek5s","end":307,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FakePsyho/status/2110397876337586635/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110384560789757952","start":284,"url":"https://t.co/CV2qr6Ek5s"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/CV2qr6Ek5s","end":307,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/FakePsyho/status/2110397876337586635/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110384623716880384","start":284,"url":"https://t.co/CV2qr6Ek5s"}]},"id":"2110397876337586635","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":5069,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"a few months ago I was extensively testing codex/claude code on the public demo of ARC-AGI-3; then astra came, obliterated the benchmark and I lost the interest\n\noriginally, I started testing it, because I was tired of the misleading \"Humans score 100%, AI &lt;1%\" narrative from the https://t.co/CV2qr6Ek5s","url":"https://x.com/FakePsyho/status/2110397876337586635"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109862868040536064"]},"author_id":"2104184692136415232","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:24:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109862896683360700"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jryo2Nft4p","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Shree_hlg/status/2109862896683360700/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109862868040536064","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/jryo2Nft4p"}]},"id":"2109862896683360700","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Anthropic says it has made it much harder to copy Claude by \"distillation\" - training a smaller model on a bigger model's answers.\n\nWhat Anthropic reports:\n\n- Early evidence suggests its new methods cut the data distillers harvest by around 90 to 99 percent\n\n- The prize is https://t.co/jryo2Nft4p","url":"https://x.com/Shree_hlg/status/2109862896683360700"},{"author_id":"2697324559","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:57:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110127715001286949"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/ValsAI/status/…","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ValsAI/status/2110113232501567805","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/QqlHCGEZ2E"}]},"id":"2110127715001286949","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Excellent new benchmark dropped. \n\nSWE-bench Multimodal asks a model to fix a real GitHub issue in a JavaScript repository. The bug report depends on images: a chart with the wrong axis labels, a diagram editor that drops a connection, or a syntax highlighter that colors a https://t.co/QqlHCGEZ2E","url":"https://x.com/kkurilyak/status/2110127715001286949"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110192588691234816"]},"author_id":"1366752206058180608","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:15:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110192621134192839"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Test your prompts, agents, and RAGs. Red teaming/pentesting/vulnerability scanning for AI. Compare performance of GPT, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, and more. Simple declarative configs with command li...","display_url":"github.com/promptfoo/prom…","end":132,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/promptfoo/promptfoo","images":[{"height":600,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108862156137480193/qVMvHcJV?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108862156137480193/qVMvHcJV?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":109,"status":200,"title":"GitHub - promptfoo/promptfoo: Test your prompts, agents, and RAGs. Red teaming/pentesting/vulnerability scanning for AI. Compare performance of GPT, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, and more. Simple declarative configs with command line and CI/CD integration. Used by OpenAI and Anthropic.","unwound_url":"https://github.com/promptfoo/promptfoo","url":"https://t.co/bvDP7PML6n"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/HsskviIRWm","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/victor_explore/status/2110192621134192839/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110192588691234816","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/HsskviIRWm"}]},"id":"2110192621134192839","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":790,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":2},"text":"📊 Bookmark these 10 GitHub repos that test your AI agent before your users do\n\n1. Promptfoo (26K stars, MIT)\nhttps://t.co/bvDP7PML6n\nTest prompts, models and agents from one config file. Compare outputs side by side and run it in CI. It also does red-teaming.\n\n2. DeepEval (19K https://t.co/HsskviIRWm","url":"https://x.com/victor_explore/status/2110192621134192839"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110415933915185152"]},"author_id":"1689342996","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:02:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110415936775762032"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/DeVI521N4w","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/newlinedotco/status/2110415936775762032/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110415933915185152","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/DeVI521N4w"}]},"id":"2110415936775762032","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":346,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":2},"text":"If your coding agent solves the task but costs too much, check the harness (the program around the model) before you swap the model.\n\nIn a UC Berkeley study published with Arena, Claude Fable 5 solved 97.8% of SWE-bench Lite tasks (a public coding benchmark) in Claude Code and https://t.co/DeVI521N4w","url":"https://x.com/newlinedotco/status/2110415936775762032"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110310597715795968"]},"author_id":"1308008556","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:04:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110310728573853889"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/mjZ81L9Ilh","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/publisherinabox/status/2110310728573853889/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110310597715795968","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/mjZ81L9Ilh"}]},"id":"2110310728573853889","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":500,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🚨 BREAKING: Meta is coming directly for Claude and the enterprise AI market. Its reported Muse Wonder launch puts long-running coding and business workflows at the center of the fight.\n\nThe centerpiece is Meta's published benchmark chart. Muse Wonder Full leads Claude Opus 5.5 https://t.co/mjZ81L9Ilh","url":"https://x.com/publisherinabox/status/2110310728573853889"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109797243310211072"]},"author_id":"2092253267002798080","created_at":"2026-10-13T00:04:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109797319151636587"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Meq8TiYgPd","end":297,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/gzzonkugood/status/2109797319151636587/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109797243310211072","start":274,"url":"https://t.co/Meq8TiYgPd"},{"display_url":"x.com/finkd/status/2…","end":321,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/finkd/status/2109689305073614918","start":298,"url":"https://t.co/6xAB6Jt5BR"}]},"id":"2109797319151636587","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":153,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Meta's Muse Wonder Full doesn't win every coding benchmark. It wins the long ones.\n\nMeta's own launch table, Opus 5.5 at max effort:\n\nLong-horizon coding, Wonder Full ahead:\n- SWE-Marathon (ultra-long-horizon engineer